[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4860.79, "timestamp": "01:21:00", "text": "尽管"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4863.27, "timestamp": "01:21:03", "text": "除此之外，我还需要一段时间才能完成。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4866.47, "timestamp": "01:21:06", "text": "只会说“我会的，我会的”，但永远不会去做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4868.79, "timestamp": "01:21:08", "text": "这就是问题所在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4872.709, "timestamp": "01:21:12", "text": "我知道我需要改变。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4874.709, "timestamp": "01:21:14", "text": "别再听那些关心你的人的话了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4878.63, "timestamp": "01:21:18", "text": "关于我。我从没想过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4882.31, "timestamp": "01:21:22", "text": "我不会浪费他们的时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4908.31, "timestamp": "01:21:48", "text": "不，正因如此我才会留下你。呃，那是"}]